{"2496180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ghost Town", "steam_appid": 2496180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/e4a6745ffda68d7cba767a29a8df38d4.avif?t=1776332127\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>Welcome to the supernatural world of <i>Ghost Town</i>, a single-player puzzle adventure VR game by Fireproof Games, creators of the widely acclaimed game series ‘The Room’.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HANDS-ON EXPLORATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the opening prologue set in a haunted Theatre, Ghost Town will draw you into its immersive world of 1983. With a controller in each hand and a torch to light your way, explore a variety of atmospheric locations and overcome tactile puzzles, cast spells and even summon troubled spirits to move them on to the next world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/9e48979c74e6ad39fb75e17a9d60dfa9.poster.avif?t=1776332127\" width=740 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/9e48979c74e6ad39fb75e17a9d60dfa9.webm?t=1776332127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/9e48979c74e6ad39fb75e17a9d60dfa9.mp4?t=1776332127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEET A CAST OF INTRIGUING</strong> <strong>CHARACTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a variety of expressive characters brought to life with precise motion capture and professional voice acting to tell the engaging story of Edith Penrose, a gifted ghost hunter who runs a paranormal detective agency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/d441b2081cfb4d75e573daa82b65c632.poster.avif?t=1776332127\" width=740 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/d441b2081cfb4d75e573daa82b65c632.webm?t=1776332127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/d441b2081cfb4d75e573daa82b65c632.mp4?t=1776332127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER INCREDIBLE LOCATIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the unreliable lift of a London tower block to the rusted ruins of a remote lighthouse, the locations of Ghost Town are filled with authentic details, ancient artifacts and jaw-dropping vistas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/1399bfe87d635f11b9625a457beb9ba3.poster.avif?t=1776332127\" width=740 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/1399bfe87d635f11b9625a457beb9ba3.webm?t=1776332127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/1399bfe87d635f11b9625a457beb9ba3.mp4?t=1776332127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BEGIN AN EPIC ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the mysterious disappearance of her brother, Edith’s world is turned upside down. Her desperation for the truth takes her to a remote Scottish island in the hope a gifted clairvoyant can provide some much-needed answers, though nothing can prepare Edith for what she will find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/dd156ad66e9356a0100cd1e20b91b4d8.poster.avif?t=1776332127\" width=740 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/dd156ad66e9356a0100cd1e20b91b4d8.webm?t=1776332127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/dd156ad66e9356a0100cd1e20b91b4d8.mp4?t=1776332127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fireproof Games are a small independent team based in Guildford, UK. <i>Ghost Town</i> is the result of over 4 years of development and we hope you enjoy playing it as much as we enjoyed making it.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/e4a6745ffda68d7cba767a29a8df38d4.avif?t=1776332127\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>Welcome to the supernatural world of <i>Ghost Town</i>, a single-player puzzle adventure VR game by Fireproof Games, creators of the widely acclaimed game series ‘The Room’.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HANDS-ON EXPLORATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the opening prologue set in a haunted Theatre, Ghost Town will draw you into its immersive world of 1983. With a controller in each hand and a torch to light your way, explore a variety of atmospheric locations and overcome tactile puzzles, cast spells and even summon troubled spirits to move them on to the next world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/9e48979c74e6ad39fb75e17a9d60dfa9.poster.avif?t=1776332127\" width=740 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/9e48979c74e6ad39fb75e17a9d60dfa9.webm?t=1776332127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/9e48979c74e6ad39fb75e17a9d60dfa9.mp4?t=1776332127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEET A CAST OF INTRIGUING</strong> <strong>CHARACTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a variety of expressive characters brought to life with precise motion capture and professional voice acting to tell the engaging story of Edith Penrose, a gifted ghost hunter who runs a paranormal detective agency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/d441b2081cfb4d75e573daa82b65c632.poster.avif?t=1776332127\" width=740 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/d441b2081cfb4d75e573daa82b65c632.webm?t=1776332127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/d441b2081cfb4d75e573daa82b65c632.mp4?t=1776332127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER INCREDIBLE LOCATIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the unreliable lift of a London tower block to the rusted ruins of a remote lighthouse, the locations of Ghost Town are filled with authentic details, ancient artifacts and jaw-dropping vistas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/1399bfe87d635f11b9625a457beb9ba3.poster.avif?t=1776332127\" width=740 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/1399bfe87d635f11b9625a457beb9ba3.webm?t=1776332127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/1399bfe87d635f11b9625a457beb9ba3.mp4?t=1776332127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BEGIN AN EPIC ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the mysterious disappearance of her brother, Edith’s world is turned upside down. Her desperation for the truth takes her to a remote Scottish island in the hope a gifted clairvoyant can provide some much-needed answers, though nothing can prepare Edith for what she will find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/dd156ad66e9356a0100cd1e20b91b4d8.poster.avif?t=1776332127\" width=740 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/dd156ad66e9356a0100cd1e20b91b4d8.webm?t=1776332127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496180/extras/dd156ad66e9356a0100cd1e20b91b4d8.mp4?t=1776332127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fireproof Games are a small independent team based in Guildford, UK. <i>Ghost Town</i> is the result of over 4 years of development and we hope you enjoy playing it as much as we enjoyed making it.</p>", "short_description": "Ghost Town is a single player VR puzzle-adventure from the makers of The Room. London, 1983. Edith Penrose is a ghost hunter, busy exorcising her way through the city's restless spirits. But after her brother goes missing Edith must draw upon her wits &amp; supernatural talents to unravel the mystery.", "supported_languages": "Eng